WEBVTT

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Miss! It's morning!

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:15.380
Miss!

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.370
M-My head...

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:23.330
You have a hangover.

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:26.170
S-So this is what a hangover is like.

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:27.670
Ow...

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.540
I'm never drinking alcohol ever again.

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:33.030
Miss?

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:34.090
Look at me! Don't close your eyes!

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:36.290
This is nothing!

00:02:07.410 --> 00:02:11.980
An Injured Man, the Royal Capital, and a Game of Tag with Sons

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:14.360
Hey! Wake up!

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:16.600
Kenison! Answer me!

00:02:16.600 --> 00:02:19.700
Kenison! Damn it!

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:22.780
What's wrong?

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:25.410
They're merchants traveling
to the royal capital.

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:28.550
Apparently they were attacked
by ogres in a nearby forest.

00:02:28.550 --> 00:02:31.330
I think that one's beyond help.

00:02:31.610 --> 00:02:32.560
Search.

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:34.000
Kenison

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.220
Poison...

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:37.190
Move, please.

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.260
Wh-What the?

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:43.870
Extra Skill: Load: Double Spell.

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:46.680
A Double Spell?!

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:07.150
Magic Skill: Pa Nil: Ready Set.

00:03:07.150 --> 00:03:11.910
Magic Spell: Dewl Level 9: Ready Set.

00:03:11.910 --> 00:03:12.580
Heal!

00:03:32.910 --> 00:03:35.390
His wounds... I can't believe it.

00:03:35.390 --> 00:03:36.690
Kenison!

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:40.070
Yes!

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:42.130
Thank goodness.

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:43.900
Well, I'll be going now.

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:45.090
M-Missy!

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:46.030
Missy?

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:49.870
Thank you for saving my friend's life.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:51.360
Thank you so much!

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:55.810
No, no, it's fine! You should get him
into a bed as soon as you can, though.

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:59.510
Y-Yes, you're right. Boys!

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:00.130
Yes, sir!

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:02.210
You can come to my inn. This way.

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:06.590
I'm in charge of this caravan.
My name is Elineh.

00:04:06.590 --> 00:04:07.550
I'm Cayna.

00:04:07.770 --> 00:04:10.990
I'd like to thank you for helping us.

00:04:10.990 --> 00:04:14.750
Is there anything I can do for you?

00:04:15.570 --> 00:04:19.650
Ah, so you've been holed up for 200 years.

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:22.110
And you're looking for someone?

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:25.990
You're pretty familiar with the
royal capital of Felskeilo, right?

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:30.040
Yes. I've been there
countless times on business.

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:31.790
What is this person like?

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:33.470
He's a male elf.

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:35.410
Ah, an elf, eh?

00:04:35.410 --> 00:04:36.730
And a priest.

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:38.920
Yes, yes, a pri—

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:39.750
Huh?

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:45.840
An elven priest in the royal capital?
It couldn't be...

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:48.450
His name is Skargo.

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:50.760
What?!

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:57.960
Y-You know Lord Skargo?

00:04:57.960 --> 00:04:59.860
Is he that famous?

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:05.370
High Priest Skargo is a wise man who's been
around since the great upheaval 200 years ago.

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:09.040
He has the most influence
after the king and prime minister.

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:12.700
Wow, he became a high priest.

00:05:13.010 --> 00:05:17.150
That boy who got hurt is
fine now. He's fast asleep.

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:24.850
I-If you don't mind me asking,
may I ask how you know Lord Skargo?

00:05:24.850 --> 00:05:25.920
He's my son.

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:28.140
What?!

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:34.060
C-Cayna... Y-You have a child at your age?

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:36.890
Actually, I have two other children, too.

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:39.270
Wh-What?!

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:43.590
So it sounds like Skargo is
doing well. That's great.

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.500
So, Elineh...

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:46.730
Y-Yes?

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:49.280
Would you let me accompany
you and your caravan?

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:53.550
What? Are you saying you want
to go to the royal capital with us?

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:56.130
Yes. Is that all right?

00:05:56.130 --> 00:05:59.900
That's fine with us.
We welcome you with open arms.

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:03.020
But the little missy there
might not feel the same.

00:06:04.740 --> 00:06:06.330
Lytt...

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:08.530
You're leaving?

00:06:08.530 --> 00:06:12.740
Y-Yes. But I promise I'll
come back to see you again.

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:13.890
Really?

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:16.200
Yes, I promise.

00:06:16.860 --> 00:06:18.640
Oh, I know.

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:19.620
Item Box

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:20.790
Item Box

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:28.380
In the game—I mean...

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:30.950
This is the first item I ever made.

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:32.070
You can have it.

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:33.990
This seals the deal on our promise.

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:35.830
Our promise...

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:40.050
I'll let you know something
else super amazing, too.

00:06:41.090 --> 00:06:43.290
But you can't tell anyone, okay?

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:46.210
O-Okay. I promise I'll keep it a secret.

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:52.740
You know that silver tower
beyond the mountains?

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:54.680
The place where the bad witch lives, right?

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:58.730
Believe it or not... I'm that bad witch.

00:06:58.730 --> 00:06:59.490
What?!

00:07:05.380 --> 00:07:07.540
But you're not a bad person!

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:10.720
Make sure you keep it a secret, okay?

00:07:10.720 --> 00:07:15.550
I'm going to come back every once in a
while to make sure you didn't tell anyone.

00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:20.480
Okay! But if you don't come back for a really
long time, I'm going to tell someone.

00:07:23.110 --> 00:07:26.590
Then I'd better make sure
I come back to this village.

00:07:34.440 --> 00:07:36.970
Allow me to formally introduce myself.

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:40.670
I am Arbiter, the leader of
the Flame Spears mercenaries.

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:42.420
We'll be accompanying
you to the royal capital.

00:07:42.790 --> 00:07:45.310
Thanks for letting me come along.

00:07:45.550 --> 00:07:46.720
Hey, Kenison.

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:48.070
Y-Yes, sir!

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:52.740
I heard that you saved me.
You are a lifesaver.

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:56.660
Thank you so much! Lady C-C-C-C-Cayna!

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:59.110
There were definitely too many Cs there.

00:07:59.110 --> 00:08:02.300
And you don't need to call me "Lady."

00:08:02.300 --> 00:08:04.330
Just call me Cayna.

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:09.250
Then... Then I'll call you Miss Cayna.

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:13.230
Er, you don't really need the "Miss," either.

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:14.950
Be careful.

00:08:14.950 --> 00:08:15.960
Come back soon!

00:08:15.960 --> 00:08:17.770
Bring your son with you next time!

00:08:17.770 --> 00:08:19.560
Thanks for everything!

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:20.970
Miss!

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:35.330
I wonder what the royal
capital of Felskeilo is like.

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:37.710
What the heck does "Primo" mean?

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:40.990
Er, my stomach just growled...

00:08:39.940 --> 00:08:40.990
What?!

00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:45.410
I wonder if they'd think
less of me as a blonde.

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:51.920
Wow...

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:55.460
Wow...

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:58.220
Wow...

00:08:58.220 --> 00:08:59.930
My, oh, my...

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:01.520
Oh, my.

00:09:03.350 --> 00:09:07.060
I can't believe they built a city here.

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:10.830
Lady Cayna, this is the
royal capital of Felskeilo,

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:12.900
otherwise known as the scenic capital.

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:16.030
If you ever need anything, come see us.

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:17.820
You're welcome anytime.

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:19.280
I will.

00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:24.200
U-Um...

00:09:24.430 --> 00:09:27.620
Elineh recommended this inn to me.

00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:30.790
Oh, meow I see. Elineh told you to come, eh?

00:09:31.140 --> 00:09:33.710
Are humans not allowed here?

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:39.720
There are a lot of humans who still
don't take mew kindly to our folk.

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:44.310
Don't worry. I'm not actually human, either.

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:53.950
Excuse me.

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:57.680
I heard that Skargo was here.

00:09:57.680 --> 00:10:01.660
Ah, the high priest. Yes, he is.

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:03.830
Is it possible to see him?

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:08.580
I'm afraid if you do not have an
appointment, that is not possible.

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:11.680
Yeah, of course.

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:16.130
And I shouldn't go disrupting
that boy's life, either.

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:17.310
That boy?

00:10:17.310 --> 00:10:19.030
Well, sorry for the trouble.

00:10:21.280 --> 00:10:24.370
I guess I do need an appointment after all.

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:28.570
Oh, well. I guess I'll head to
the Adventurers' Guild first.

00:10:28.570 --> 00:10:30.440
What are you doing?!

00:10:31.030 --> 00:10:33.480
That's not it!

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:37.490
Do I need to explain
everything more than once?

00:10:38.090 --> 00:10:39.400
Pick up the pace!

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:42.600
R-Right, boss! Sorry!

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:43.550
For cryin' out loud...

00:10:43.550 --> 00:10:44.270
Huh?

00:10:47.890 --> 00:10:49.160
Kartatz!

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:56.130
Kar...tatz?

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:58.470
M-Mum!

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:02.550
Y-Y-Y-You okay, Mum?!

00:11:02.920 --> 00:11:04.470
Are you not feeling well?

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:07.310
No, I just... wasn't expecting
you to call me that,

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:10.090
or maybe it was even weirder than I imagined.

00:11:10.090 --> 00:11:13.400
But it's been a while. How've you been?

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:20.460
Hey! I'm not a little child anymore!

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:22.660
Stop patting me on the head!

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:28.080
Well, this is pretty neat. How cute.

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:32.850
Don't call an old man "cute"! That's creepy!

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:37.920
What?!

00:11:38.150 --> 00:11:41.430
You left the tower and became an adventurer?!

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:46.350
Yeah. It's pretty rough with so much
being different than 200 years ago.

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:50.020
Are you going to d-destroy
a country or something?

00:11:51.610 --> 00:11:53.550
Huh? What's wrong?

00:11:53.860 --> 00:11:55.650
Don't "what's wrong" me!

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:58.210
I thought my skull was gonna shatter!

00:11:58.880 --> 00:12:04.070
I stopped by the church before coming here,
but the sister wouldn't let me in.

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:10.960
You went to see Big Bro?
Of course you were turned away.

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:14.720
Yeah. Do you happen to know where Mai-Mai is?

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:17.500
Sis is the headmaster at the academy there.

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:21.130
Aw, you've all grown up so well.

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:22.850
I see.

00:12:22.850 --> 00:12:26.160
I-I'll go ahead and talk to them for you.

00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:28.140
Okay, I'm counting on you.

00:12:31.960 --> 00:12:34.030
What're you fools smirking about?!

00:12:36.710 --> 00:12:40.600
If you'd like to register for the
Adventurers' Guild, please fill these out.

00:12:40.600 --> 00:12:45.410
I'm in a fantasy world, yet I'm using
a pencil rather than a quill pen.

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:47.860
Here you go.

00:12:47.860 --> 00:12:51.240
Wow, it's rare to see a high elf around here.

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:54.520
O-Oh, it's actually a rare race?

00:12:54.520 --> 00:12:58.250
I'll get your registration card.
One moment, please.

00:12:58.250 --> 00:12:59.590
Thanks!

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:04.090
"Please capture this monster."

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:06.090
Bodyguard, investigate an affair...

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:10.250
"I'd like a potion. Reward: two silver coins."

00:13:11.030 --> 00:13:14.280
I do have a high potion
I made a long time ago.

00:13:14.910 --> 00:13:16.450
I wonder if this will work.

00:13:16.450 --> 00:13:19.420
Kee, this is pretty old,
but do you think it's still okay?

00:13:19.420 --> 00:13:22.270
I believe that it should still be effective.

00:13:22.270 --> 00:13:23.590
Cayna!

00:13:23.590 --> 00:13:24.860
Oh, coming!

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:30.300
Here you go. Your Adventurers'
Guild registration card.

00:13:30.300 --> 00:13:32.040
Thanks.

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:35.960
Oh, will this work for this potion request?

00:13:40.730 --> 00:13:42.610
Is that some kind of appraisal skill?

00:13:44.150 --> 00:13:45.630
Yes, that takes care of it.

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:49.630
But isn't this a rather high-end potion?

00:13:49.630 --> 00:13:50.910
Are you sure about this?

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:53.570
Yes. I haven't used it in a while, so...

00:13:53.570 --> 00:13:55.560
I see. In that case,

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:57.630
here's your reward of two silvers.

00:13:57.630 --> 00:13:59.730
Thank you very much.

00:14:00.050 --> 00:14:02.970
I guess this is my first step as an adventurer.

00:14:03.970 --> 00:14:09.210
This is just like when I first logged in
to Leadale and stood out on the field.

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:12.050
Missy, you're an adventurer, aren't you?

00:14:12.050 --> 00:14:14.200
Uh, yes, I am.

00:14:15.850 --> 00:14:18.260
No need to be so guarded.

00:14:18.260 --> 00:14:20.260
My name is Agaido.

00:14:20.260 --> 00:14:24.580
Come, now. Stop hiding
behind me and introduce yourself.

00:14:24.580 --> 00:14:26.880
I-I'm Lonti.

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:28.580
My name is Cayna.

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:33.040
You seem rather skilled.
Mind helping us out for a bit?

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:35.310
Is this an official quest, then?

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:38.560
Yes. We happen to be looking for someone.

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:40.230
Will you help us out?

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:42.900
W-Was that supposed to be a wink?

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:46.740
S-Sure, as long as you pay me.

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:52.410
Don't worry. You'll get your
payment if you see this through.

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:54.410
Yeah, that was supposed to be a wink.

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:58.200
All right. I accept.

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:00.170
Grin...

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:06.470
Well, I'll search on my own.
Lonti, you go with Cayna.

00:15:06.470 --> 00:15:08.860
M-Me? Go with Miss Cayna?

00:15:08.860 --> 00:15:11.800
Well, Cayna doesn't know
who we're looking for.

00:15:12.030 --> 00:15:13.680
I'm counting on you.

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:17.540
Bye now.

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:19.680
Lonti... was it?

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:22.880
Do you not like elves?

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:25.350
I-I'm sorry!

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:28.440
It's not that you scare me or anything.

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:34.120
I'm Cayna, a high elf.
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:37.280
I'm a first-year adventurer
from the Royal Academy,

00:15:37.280 --> 00:15:39.180
and my name is Lonti Arbalest.

00:15:39.180 --> 00:15:41.850
I-It's a pleasure to meet you, as well.

00:15:41.850 --> 00:15:45.040
Wait, you're a high elf, Miss Cayna?!

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:48.550
What's elf royalty doing here?

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:51.940
Oh, every world has their exceptions.

00:15:51.940 --> 00:15:55.960
Anyway, let's go. So what
does this person look like?

00:15:55.960 --> 00:15:57.140
O-Oh, sorry!

00:15:57.140 --> 00:16:00.560
Um, we're looking for someone
a little younger than me...

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:02.270
With red hair...

00:16:05.380 --> 00:16:07.560
I must say, that's rather vague.

00:16:07.560 --> 00:16:09.070
H-He's a boy!

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:10.350
Oh?

00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:16.300
U-Um, Miss Cayna? Why did we come here?

00:16:16.300 --> 00:16:18.090
Hm...

00:16:18.090 --> 00:16:19.370
Just because.

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:21.800
Really? That's it?

00:16:21.800 --> 00:16:22.700
Hey!

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:27.240
Stop that!

00:16:27.240 --> 00:16:27.790
Look out!

00:16:28.810 --> 00:16:29.670
Be careful!

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:31.670
A boy with red hair...

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:36.400
Don't move. Just stay still...

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:40.470
He's falling!

00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:42.890
Magic Skill: Load: Float.

00:16:48.130 --> 00:16:49.830
That's impressive, kid...

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:52.500
Thanks, Missy.

00:16:52.500 --> 00:16:54.380
Hey, no problem.

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:57.210
Are you okay?

00:16:57.210 --> 00:16:59.700
Yeah. That was pretty amazing, la—

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:00.620
Lon—

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:02.990
We finally found you, Pri—

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:06.840
I mean... Young Master.

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:12.850
Young Master? Ah, I see.
That's what kind of event this is.

00:17:12.850 --> 00:17:17.140
I did 4,000 quests, but I never
had one like this before.

00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:19.390
U-Um, here!

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:20.480
Huh?!

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:21.270
See ya!

00:17:21.760 --> 00:17:24.690
Hey! Wh-What am I supposed to do with this?

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:26.110
He sure is fast.

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:28.480
Er, Miss Cayna!

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:31.150
Don't just stand there
admiring him! Catch him!

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:32.900
Oh, sure thing.

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:35.200
Active Skill: Leap.

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:40.980
Come back here!

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:42.830
Wha—

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:45.050
You're not getting away from me!

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:52.500
Just be a good boy and surrender, Primo.

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:54.420
P-Primo?

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:57.180
Who the heck're you calling Primo?!

00:17:57.180 --> 00:18:00.970
That sounded like what Lonti
was trying to call you.

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:01.430
Over here!

00:18:02.630 --> 00:18:04.770
You're not getting away with this, Lonti!

00:18:16.600 --> 00:18:19.230
W-Well? How d'you like them apples?!

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:29.040
Let me catch you already!

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:31.180
Wh-What the heck?!

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:37.470
Stay away from me! Go away!

00:18:50.140 --> 00:18:51.450
Damn it...

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:56.150
You're really something. Here's your reward.

00:18:57.840 --> 00:18:59.320
You're paying me this much?!

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:03.850
I made a bet with some of those onlookers
who were watching your little race there.

00:19:03.850 --> 00:19:06.090
A 50-50 split sounds fair, doesn't it?

00:19:06.090 --> 00:19:09.330
Jeez, you can't let your
guard down with this guy.

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:13.880
Damn it! Who the heck are you, anyway?

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:17.090
Did you do this knowing who I really am?

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:20.220
I can pretty much figure it out,
but "Primo" suits you just fine.

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:22.770
I don't want to get too involved, anyway.

00:19:22.770 --> 00:19:26.830
Oh? Then do you know what's
going on with this boy?

00:19:26.830 --> 00:19:30.270
Lonti was trying to call him
"Pri—something" earlier.

00:19:32.240 --> 00:19:36.940
I bet you ran away because
you got sick of your boring life.

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:41.740
Lonti! I'm being called
Primo now because of you!

00:19:42.870 --> 00:19:43.910
I'm terribly sorry.

00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:49.000
Well, thank you for your hard work.

00:19:51.260 --> 00:19:53.810
What's the big idea?! Hey!

00:19:53.810 --> 00:19:57.580
I'm so sorry about this, Miss Cayna.
Thank you for everything.

00:19:54.030 --> 00:19:58.340
Put me down! Let go! Stop it!

00:19:58.340 --> 00:20:02.260
Damn it! Put me down! Listen to me!

00:19:59.910 --> 00:20:01.670
He's carrying him around so easily.

00:20:05.250 --> 00:20:07.890
I'm back... huh?

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:10.270
Welcome back! We were waiting for you!

00:20:12.200 --> 00:20:15.970
We heard mew did something
interesting at the river.

00:20:15.970 --> 00:20:18.650
Everyone's been purrfectly
anxious to hear all about it!

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:22.560
A-Actually, I promised myself
I'd never drink again.

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:23.370
Meow?

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:35.670
Okay. I'll drink. Let's all drink!

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:41.550
What did you say?!

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:47.940
Why in the world didn't you call me sooner?!

00:20:47.940 --> 00:20:49.530
How could I?

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:51.160
I see.

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:54.100
So Mother Dearest is here in this city.

00:20:54.360 --> 00:20:57.330
I must do everything I can
to give her a warm welcome!

00:20:58.060 --> 00:21:01.740
Just don't. You know Mother
will get mad at you.

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:05.100
Don't you remember why our
mother got sick of people

00:21:05.100 --> 00:21:07.040
and holed herself up in the forest?

00:21:07.040 --> 00:21:08.160
Right...

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:11.880
Anyway, Mother is an adventurer now, eh?

00:21:11.880 --> 00:21:13.000
Oh, wait.

00:21:13.610 --> 00:21:15.950
Then could that potion be...

00:21:15.950 --> 00:21:16.920
Potion?

00:21:17.260 --> 00:21:22.420
Our school received a potion that was
made in a way no one uses anymore.

00:21:22.830 --> 00:21:25.740
One of my husband's students
couldn't do their assignment,

00:21:25.740 --> 00:21:29.720
so they sent a request
to the Adventurers' Guild.

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:32.580
So Mother must be the one who made it.

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:39.120
Indeed. But Mother Dearest should've
let us know that she was here.

00:21:39.120 --> 00:21:41.730
She told me that she wasn't
allowed into your place.

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:45.520
Oho... So not only did someone not
tell me Mother Dearest came to see me,

00:21:45.520 --> 00:21:46.960
but they sent her away!

00:21:46.960 --> 00:21:50.950
How dare they blaspheme my
beloved Mother Dearest like that?!

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:53.160
They shall pay dearly for—

00:21:53.460 --> 00:21:56.320
Oh, stop being so extreme.

00:21:56.660 --> 00:22:00.590
You know that our kind mother
would never want that.

00:22:00.590 --> 00:22:02.100
True...

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:09.010
Is this kingdom going to survive
having a high priest like him?
